# Decimal Numbers in JavaScript
This repository contains a collection of tests and code for decimal numbers in JavaScript.

## Running Tests
Commands are below:

```bash
npm i && npm run test
```
You can also use [Mocha](https://mochajs.org/) directly with [Chai](http://chaijs.com/) assertions:
```javascript
const decimal = require('decimal')
const assert = require('assert')

describe('Decimal Numbers', () => {
  it('does something', () => {
    // Add your own assertions here...
    const bigInt = new BigInt(1e10)
    assert.deepStrictEqual(decimal.add(bigInt, 0).toString(), '1e+10')
  })
})
```

